OL,3,ATwo unvaccinated people die of measles
OL,4,Ain Pennsylvania
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo people who were not vaccinated
OL,7,Fagainst measles have died of the virus
OL,8,Fin Pennsylvania, health officials said.
OL,10,FThe state has seen 393 cases of the
OL,11,Fhighly contagious virus this year, as
OL,12,Finfections across the US have hit the
OL,13,Fhighest point in 35 years.
OL,15,FEighty-five percent of kindergarten-age
OL,16,Fstudents in Lancaster County, where the
OL,17,Frecent deaths occurred, are vaccinated
OL,18,Fagainst measles - well below the 95%
OL,19,Frate needed for herd immunity to limit
OL,20,Fthe spread and protect
OL,21,Fimmunocompromised people.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
