OL,3,ATwo unvaccinated people die of measles
OL,4,Ain Pennsylvania
OL,5,
OL,6,FLast year, two unvaccinated children in
OL,7,FTexas died from a measles outbreak that
OL,8,Finfected over 1,000 people, primarily
OL,9,Fchildren.
